  "docText": [
    "SOLAR®",
    "Biamp Design System",
    "1.0",
    "Text Area",
    "Description",
    "A multi-line field for longer free-form text — comments, descriptions, notes. Grows or scrolls with content. Not for single-line entry (use Text Input).",
    "Usage",
    "Use when input may exceed one line. Show a character counter where limits apply. Allow resize where space permits.",
    "States",
    "Default · Hover · Focus · Filled\nDisabled — muted, non-editable.\nError — invalid value; message + aria-invalid.",
    "Sizes",
    "sm   Dense forms.\nmd   Default. Comfortable multi-line entry.",
    "Accessibility",
    "Programmatic label; error sets aria-invalid and links a message. Announce character-limit state politely. Visible focus ring.",
    "Rules",
    "DO   Show a visible label\nDO   Add a counter when limited\nDO   Surface errors inline\nDO   Allow resize where useful",
    "DON'T   Use for single-line input\nDON'T   Hide the label\nDON'T   Rely on colour alone for errors\nDON'T   Fix a tiny height for long content"
  ],
  "pageContext": null
